de":"automorphismGroup()"},{"type":"text","text":": the permutations of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its vertices that keep every edge multiplicity (and the colours, when given), described by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"generators, by the orbits they cut the vertices into, and by its order.","type":"text"}]}}}